{"id": 32, "ts": 1780444468.9599128, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I understand that both James and Emily have leaned toward Candidate\u202fB because of his strong stress handling and technical aptitude. However, the notes on B also flag a tendency to be grumpy and uncooperative, which directly threatens crew cooperation and professional communication\u2014key safety\u2011critical criteria for long\u2011haul flights. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC is described as 100\u202f% reliable and consistently creates a positive atmosphere with his crew, indicating strong cooperation and responsibility. While C does have difficulty communicating ideas and appears egocentric, his proven reliability and rapid, correct decision\u2011making are essential for operational safety. Given that crew harmony and dependable performance outweigh the communication quirks that can be mitigated with training, I maintain my recommendation for Candidate\u202fC."}
